  "pageshortdescription": {
    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "shortDescTop": "<p>The EPF system is designed for the treatment of plantar fasciosis. The EPF system is a minimally invasive surgical technique for chronic plantar fasciitis (fasciosis). The plantar fascia is the flat band of tissue (ligament) that connects the heel bone to the toes. It supports the arch of the foot.<br />\r\n</p>\r\n",
